  <!-- Column 2 Text -->
  <div slot="col-2-text">
    <p>
      When Westmuir Defibrillator Group joined up,<br>
      With the Community Heartbeat Trust ;<br>
      In the old phone box at the Shoppie,<br>
      To give your support now is a MUST.<br>
      Getting it up and running,<br>
      Would be a great day for us all;<br>
      If everyone gave their very best,<br>
      Whether it be large or small.<br>
      Financial help is still needed,<br>
      And gifts of kind are welcome too;<br>
      Ideas to brighten up the site,<br>
      To make it fresh and new.<br>
      No longer a sleepy village,<br>
      We could save a life you see;<br>
      Having the equipment here,<br>
      A great achievement you’ll agree.<br>
      So throw your whole self in it,<br>
      Work on it with a smile;<br>
      I know you won’t regret it,<br>
      When you go that extra mile.<br>
      Westmuir’s Defibrillator<br>
      By Eila Webster
    </p>
  </div>

